#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:5
#: 1f74abe87fb04c8483ae27eb8f38682b
msgid "Nanoradar NRA 24"
msgstr "Nanoradar NRA 24"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:8
#: a4017cfe3c4f4c35a1493489901434da
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in firmware versions 4.5 and later."
msgstr "固件 4.5 及更高版本支持此传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:10
#: 0bee2faf512947019be244b0aee5fc2e
msgid ""
"The `NRA24 <http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/372.html>`__ is K-band "
"radar commonly used for detecting height above terrain in all-weather "
"conditions.Currently, only connection via CAN is supported for more than one"
" NRA24 module. Serial (UART) versions of this Radar have only been tested "
"with a single NRA24 module."
msgstr ""
"`NRA24 <http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/372.html>`__ 是 K "
"频段雷达，常用于全天候地形高度探测。目前，多个 NRA24 模块的连接仅支持 CAN 接口。串口（UART）版本仅经过单个 NRA24 模块的测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:14
#: 910eb76e7b964c5eb93a9828a272d068
msgid "Connecting via CAN"
msgstr "通过 CAN 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:16
#: ad09254846214f1884253c992767ec64
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NSM Software. In particular set the \"ID\" to a"
" unique number if planning to use multiple NRA24 on a single CAN bus. You "
"can also set the bitrate from the software."
msgstr "通过 NSM 软件配置传感器。若计划在同一 CAN 总线上使用多个 NRA24，请将「ID」设置为唯一编号。也可通过软件设置波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:19
#: eaf398f3d44c4449b0b680213c3b7519
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support the same type CAN rangefinders "
"connected to different CAN ports. If you would like to use multiple CAN "
"rangefinders together, connect them to the same bus."
msgstr "ArduPilot 目前不支持将同类 CAN 测距仪连接至不同 CAN 接口。若需同时使用多个 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接至同一总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:23
#: 2077b60e9b96428badf2ed73e237b3b7
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:24
#: 04fa406acc92419ab3d1ef9a5ffe159c
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NSM tools provided by the manufacturer. More "
"details can be found `here "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/download/id/467.html>`__. Set the \"ID\" to a "
"unique number if planning to use multiple NRA24 on a single CAN bus. You can"
" also set the bitrate from the software to match the CAN bus bitrate (500000"
" is recommended)."
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NSM 工具配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/download/id/467.html>`__ 获取。若计划在同一 CAN 总线上使用多个 "
"NRA24，请将「ID」设置为唯一编号。也可通过软件设置波特率以匹配 CAN 总线波特率（推荐 500000）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:26
#: 32947062b6d443b5a9de7aa34fc45c80
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare CAN port. Since this is not a "
"DroneCAN based sensor, you will not be able to use the connected port with "
"any other sensor. The diagram below shows how to connect to CAN2."
msgstr ""
"串口连接可使用任意空闲 CAN 接口。由于该传感器不基于 DroneCAN，所连接的接口将无法与其他传感器共用。下图展示了连接至 CAN2 的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:31
#: 47e9120ab867465586b44a22b32c90a6
msgid "Set the following parameters"
msgstr "设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:33
#: 197c53b29e5145578c232b8c6c819716
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 2 (to enable the second CAN driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 2（启用第二 CAN 驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:34
#: f819c20f2cf04c0b8939ea91166180d3
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE <CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 500000 (or as set in NSM tools)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE <CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 500000（或与 NSM 工具中设置一致）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:35
#: 7a31ab09209c4da3905bf169ad4ee011
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL <CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (NanoRadar)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL <CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14（NanoRadar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:36
#: 06586adaabaf4ad4b0a9ad6bcd4a24d8
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 39 (NRA-24). Reboot after setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 39（NRA-24），设置后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:55
#: 71be10f347e94ad2a904068a8bff4e22 7d88ab871fea4d5b821a540e5e503155
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 190 (i.e. 200m max range with 10m buffer)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 190（即最大量程 200m，留 10m 缓冲）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:56
#: 268340947de7455499b45b0fba19a8e9 bacaa508f2ea494b9ce14a60f2407197
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5 (0.5m min range)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5（最小量程 0.5m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:39
#: 4e2cc92600a04a7c892f119099f14bb1
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = ID of the sensor (0 to accept all"
" CAN ids for distance)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = 传感器 ID（设为 0 可接受所有 CAN ID 的距离数据）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:43
#: b827c65f824842ac8c9040893f7eb149
msgid "Connecting via UART"
msgstr "通过 UART 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:45
#: 78c90fff80214258bd04fa6075b056fd
msgid ""
"This is the recommended configuration by Nanoradar given `here "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/495.html>`__, but ArduPilot has "
"not verified that all operational edge cases are satisfied using the USD-1 "
"driver. Caution is advised."
msgstr ""
"这是 Nanoradar 推荐的配置（见 `此处 "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/495.html>`__），但 ArduPilot 尚未验证使用 "
"USD-1 驱动时所有边界情况均满足要求。建议谨慎使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:50
#: 6934f021ff024102aaf50b4d57eff12a
msgid "Set the following parameters (Example for setup on TELEM1/SERIAL1)"
msgstr "设置以下参数（以在 TELEM1/SERIAL1 上配置为例）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:52
#: 37a96f4f23d2462883a955b85ce216a3
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115 (Baud rate as per the official "
"documentation `here <http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/view/id/436.html>`__)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115（波特率参见官方文档 `此处 "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/view/id/436.html>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:53
#: 27f233fe8dbe4b91a92ca01cb72ff4fd
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (which translates to "
"Rangefinder)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 9（即测距仪协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:54
#: 0d01eea62d8c411299e8edec4044d9e7
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 11 (which is USD1_Serial). Reboot after"
" setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 11（即 USD1_Serial），设置后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:60
#: b6005e71932a42f0ac897049012e5088
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:62
#: 8efa0cba86194c40b8472d2a6f0f14cf
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离值可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据页面的「状态」选项卡中查看，请留意「rangefinder1」项。"
